From 2190a6eb4c2d56bc20795ff8602550a2621ded0d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paul Dale <paul.dale@oracle.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 12:03:42 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Test the extended safe multiply and divide range

Check exact results, overflow, both operand orders and existing error
bits for signed and unsigned inputs through 64 bits. Cover products at
the signed minimum and intermediate products that do not fit.

Add a recipe that runs the safe arithmetic tests with built-in overflow
checks both enabled and disabled.

